---
// About section
---

<section id="about" class="py-10 px-6 md:px-10 border-b border-slate-100">
  <div class="mb-8">
    <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-600 uppercase tracking-widest">Background</span>
    <h2 class="mt-1 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">About Me</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
    <p>
      I'm a CRM Developer and IT professional based in Brisbane, QLD. Currently at
      RSL Queensland, I design and build solutions across Microsoft Dynamics 365,
      Power Platform, and Azure DevOps — helping one of Australia's largest veterans'
      organisations connect more effectively with its members.
    </p>
    <p>
      My background spans the full IT spectrum: from hands-on desktop support and
      infrastructure through to application development and release management. I enjoy
      solving real problems for real people, and I bring a practical, get-it-done
      mindset to every project.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside of work I'm expanding my skills in cloud technologies and modern web
      development — including building this site.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Quick stats -->
  <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center">
    {[
      { value: '10+', label: 'Years in IT' },
      { value: '4',   label: 'Employers' },
      { value: 'BIT', label: 'Degree from QUT' },
      { value: 'BCS', label: 'BA Foundation Cert' },
    ].map((stat) => (
      <div class="text-center px-5 py-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
        <div class="text-xl font-bold text-red-600">{stat.value}</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5 font-medium">{stat.label}</div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>
